{"id":"word:hebrew:H7860","type":"word","title":"שֹׁטֵר","subtitle":"H7860 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, a scribe , i.e. (by analogy or implication) an official superintendent or magistrate","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שֹׁטֵר (H7860) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 25 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שֹׁטֵר (shôṭêr) means properly, a scribe , i.e. (by analogy or implication) an official superintendent or magistrate First listed occurrence: 1Chr 23 4."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שֹׁטֵר","transliteration":"shôṭêr","pronunciation":"sho-tare'","strong":"H7860","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7860","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["וְ/שֹׁטְרִ֥ים","וְ/שֹׁטְרִ֖ים","הַ/שֹּׁטְרִ֖ים","שֹֽׁטְרֵי֙","לְ/שֹׁטְרִ֖ים"],"morphs":[["HC/Vqrmpa",5],["HTd/Vqrmpa",3],["HVqrmpc",3],["HC/Vqrmpc/Sp2mp",2],["HC/R/Vqrmpc/Sp3ms",2],["HR/Ncmpa",1],["HC/Ncmpc/Sp3mp",1],["HTd/Vqrmsa",1],["HC/Ncmpa",1],["HVqrmpc/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, a scribe , i.e. (by analogy or implication) an official superintendent or magistrate","usage":"officer, overseer, ruler.","full":"H7860. shoter שֹׁטֵר noun masculine official, officer (properly scribe, secretary ? or from original meaning as arranger, organizer ?); — absolute ׳שׁ Prov 6:7 , ׳שׁו 2Chr 26:11 ; plural שֹׁטְרִים Deut 1:15 +, etc.; — apparently subordinate officer , judicial, civil or military (compare Dr Deuteronomy 1. 15 Gray Num 11:16 ); organizing people for marching Josh 1:10 ; 3:2 (both E), compare Deut 20:5 , 8 , 9 ; appointed over Israel by Egyptian overseers Exod 5:14 , compare 5:6 ; 5:10 ; 5:15 ; 5:19 (all J); elsewhere + זְקֵנִים Num 11:16 (E), Deut 29:9 ; 31:28 ; + שֹׁפְטִים 16:18 ; 1Chr 23:4 ; 26:29 , + ׳ז and ׳שֹׁפ Josh 8:33 (R D ), and ( + רָאשִׁים ) 23:2 (R D ), 24:1 (E, or R D ); ׳שֹׁט as minor judges also Deut 1:15 ; ׳שֹׁט אֶתהַֿמֶּלֶךְ הַמְשָֽׁרְתִים 1Chr 27:1 , chosen from Levites 2Chr 19:11 ; 34:13 (+ שׁוֺעֲרִים סוֺפְרִים, ); as title of individual 26:11 (|| הַסּוֺפֵר ); of ant, וּמשֵׁל שֹׁטֵר קָצִין אֵיןלָֿהּ Prov 6:7 .","rootNote":"active participle of an otherwise unused root probably meaning to write;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 23 4","keyReferences":["1Chr 23 4","1Chr 26 29","1Chr 27 1","2Chr 19 11","2Chr 26 11","2Chr 34 13","Deut 1 15","Deut 16 18"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":25,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 23 4","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֹׁטְרִ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 29","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/שֹׁטְרִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 27 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":27,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֹׁטְרֵי/הֶם֩","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 19 11","book":"2Chr","chapter":19,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֹׁטְרִ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 26 11","book":"2Chr","chapter":26,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שּׁוֹטֵ֑ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Vqrmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 34 13","book":"2Chr","chapter":34,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֹׁטְרִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 1 15","book":"Deut","chapter":1,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֹׁטְרִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 16 18","book":"Deut","chapter":16,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֹֽׁטְרִ֗ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 20 5","book":"Deut","chapter":20,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שֹּֽׁטְרִים֮","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 20 8","book":"Deut","chapter":20,"verse":8,"engli